{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "911ccd1442a68fe0fc1323eeb362baf7ee19d298d4a6fb90ba7db4dee69f34de", "ja": "レディ・Iが咆える夜", "zh": "淑女·I咆哮之夜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fe3394ef3f1dd60285ad3fd4eddcc3c2a689062adac9f742c9528e21915443e4", "ja": "監禁された月兎隊とシャインナイト。オーク\nションマスターからリトルを殺せば、望みの\nお宝を渡すと言われるが、シャインナイトは\n強く拒絶。そこに自力で脱出したレディ・I\nたちが乗り込み、悪党に強烈な一撃！", "zh": "被监禁的月兔队和Shine Knight。拍卖大师表示，只要杀掉Little，就会把他们想要的宝物交给他们，但Shine Knight强烈拒绝。就在这时，凭借自身力量逃脱的Lady I等人冲了进来，给恶党以强烈一击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "7b86e384fd990b35b452f97643a942284c65aca222836ce760ef36ed3dbabae1", "ja": "オークション会場　地下室……", "zh": "拍卖会场　地下室……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "26e1c5372571729ff6c89657066800d6fc3d71a3538e06c4600fd996d5b74481", "ja": "ん……。あれ、ここは……？\nえーと、確か睡眠ガスを吸い込んで……。", "zh": "唔……。咦，这里是……？\n那个，我记得好像吸入了催眠瓦斯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "fee68ddf5471784d152c37b2a1657abe8aaed704555656e4430814d230b87533", "ja": "私たち、仲良くシュミの悪い部屋に閉じ込められた\nのよ。レディ・Iとディーディーは、別の場所みたい。", "zh": "我们被关在了一间趣味糟糕的房间里。蕾迪·I和迪迪好像被关在别的地方了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "6dd17d994d85c00d5148144b04f125a8918c5ee926961360d0124ea64bb450ca", "ja": "ええっ！？　つ、通信は……ダメか。\nまだ『輝きのダイヤ』を手に入れられてないのに……！", "zh": "诶！？联、联络……不行吗。\n明明还没拿到『闪耀之钻』……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "600d2c79db897d59770f9e4f7a6bb01fec61c812cf161d19dfdac631fe3404da", "ja": "そう。\nあなたの目的は、『輝きのダイヤ』だったの。", "zh": "这样啊。你的目的是『闪耀的钻石』啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "47ce6b41ed5a2f79a24ed5a15a9185db1cf07d2ee285816d25d761aa11e3bb8d", "ja": "わ、私……悪いと思ってないですから！\n裏切りなんて、この世界じゃフツーだし！", "zh": "我、我……可不觉得自己做错了！\n在这个世界里，背叛本来就是家常便饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "842f3f3820952ffb586ba8f022c094174731ec9bd31068bc74f2b67ac6f367f8", "ja": "私は、レディ・I先輩が持っているダイヤを、絶対に\n手に入れなくちゃならないんです！　だから……。", "zh": "我一定要拿到雷迪·I前辈拥有的钻石！所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "9d860b2592766ff9e67cd50a405bf82d88bdd81b9fc5f292d7e2bc47a470ecba", "ja": "だから、何？", "zh": "所以，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "72b5b421c641ed5758c59ab91b345e59fd3bb1485a0b3eac904299ba394e7810", "ja": "あの～……リトルさんは、他のみんなが\n捕まっちゃったのに、心配じゃないんですか……？", "zh": "那个～……利特尔小姐，其他人\n都被抓住了，你就不担心吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "025b5665c21cca0dc13ef1b8c0d58f09eb2333c9211135752add71b150c08619", "ja": "別に。いざとなれば、逃げる時間くらい稼げるし。\n私たち月兎隊は、そんなにやわじゃないから。", "zh": "没什么。真到了万不得已的时候，争取一点逃跑的时间还是做得到的。我们月兔队可没那么脆弱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1010_acmaster", "source_sha256": "0f63440566a47b5f2fc681fdd9bdb93ec3a7aac3ee037f3bc2bfdd8a41165308", "ja": "フッフッフ……私自慢の『接待室』の居心地はどうだ？\nウサギども！", "zh": "哼哼哼……我引以为傲的『接待室』，待着感觉如何？\n兔子们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "fb704cd4ce836f95d293d6d8ade4944da101b512939aa1480bd854413a4cd89d", "ja": "あっ、オークションマスター！\nねえ、どうして私まで捕まってるの！？", "zh": "啊，拍卖大师！\n等等，为什么连我也被抓起来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1012_acmaster", "source_sha256": "23e2a0d2b425677f21c6d0f39cf12e87b51c7bc683feb91152441faae31f5ef9", "ja": "私は疑い深くてね。シャインナイト、君が私を\n裏切っている可能性もある……そうだろう？", "zh": "我可是很容易怀疑别人的。闪耀骑士，你也有可能背叛我……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "31d2eccbb1646374f558b97da94075522eba2a709b7f7f64bddaaa8116f1242e", "ja": "そ、そんなわけ……！", "zh": "怎、怎么可能……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1014_acmaster", "source_sha256": "b92cff5897ea08d74d80252e752efa1890c824619773cb8181a235e470b9121c", "ja": "信じてほしければ……目の前の仔ウサギを始末しろ。\nそうすれば、貴様の望みのダイヤはくれてやる！", "zh": "如果想让我相信你……就把眼前的小兔子解决掉。\n\n这样一来，你所期望的钻石就给你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1015_acmaster", "source_sha256": "e486d80f9cd3efae3d90d181af8b5039ca8d2e53e080a60a0e3f656ba65e69ec", "ja": "もしくは、他の2人からでもいいぞ。\n貴様に選ばせてやろう。どうだ？", "zh": "或者，也可以从其他2人中选。就让你来选吧。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "6b27734124a4064ef82ce60d10985d840ec33af7de62ddd4b8b640f4bdbdb913", "ja": "そんな……！", "zh": "怎么会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "802739fb0a7d3d6bcaa5c4659da68d71e4def23eb01d2dbdf1b8f31da20e0d7e", "ja": "はぁ……呆れた。悪役のセリフって、\nどうしてこう代わり映えしないのかしら？", "zh": "唉……真让人无语。反派的台词，\n为什么总是这么千篇一律呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1018_acmaster", "source_sha256": "abc12287cabeaaf2a7c0c53ff9ba0ebf81890f2bc46b0c526337dc07d56adeff", "ja": "ええい、うるさい！　どうした、シャインナイト！\nダイヤを手に入れたければやらないか！", "zh": "够了，吵死了！怎么了，Shine Knight！\n想要获得钻石的话，要不要来做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "0c0a9d5a0b6e467d9ebed8281d35c25a03ecef9887e929e4fc0aa87ddedd0832", "ja": "いいわ、シャインナイト。かかってきなさい。\nその代わり、私も大人しくやられるつもりはないから。", "zh": "好啊，闪耀骑士。尽管放马过来吧。\n不过，我可没打算乖乖被你打败。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "e6ec398fc85d3978ce9ece2d5e3fa77898de3119cdfd26f093b49acb477ab768", "ja": "リトルさん、そんな！\nわ、私……私は……！", "zh": "小家伙，怎么会！  \n我、我……我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1021_acmaster", "source_sha256": "6163d95d2118560e0a65d80aaa2b9dc5ef3a43c116bab2c978d5aa42715aecf6", "ja": "どうした、今更躊躇しているのか？　シャインナイト。\n言うとおりにしなければ、ダイヤは手に入らないぞ？", "zh": "怎么了，事到如今还在犹豫吗？闪耀骑士。\n不按我说的做，可是拿不到钻石的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "9bc7d8b1f07119fb02e39f3a4c958dc912f61347d9c97ae4ae1d61289fbd9239", "ja": "私は……私は、怪盗シャインナイト！\n私には目的がある！　けど、ウサギ殺しなんかしない！", "zh": "我……我就是怪盗闪耀骑士！我有自己的目的！但是，我才不会去杀兔子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "3c5a547bd68398485d5e8da5da85c510231b49b1fae04a0d6ac22dbc43038d8c", "ja": "オークションマスター、あなたには従わない！\n私はダイヤを手に入れて、リトル先輩を助けてみせる！", "zh": "拍卖大师，我不会听你的！\n我要拿到钻石，把小兔前辈救出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "cbce1aef9ec2018ae69852339f23712f5813c00657796b00461bc6b29b57c7df", "ja": "あら、意外と言うじゃない。シャインナイト。", "zh": "哎呀，口气倒是不小嘛。闪耀骑士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1025_acmaster", "source_sha256": "d0fc742bb756c55f6adfa7a9122c7094077e54c0b527475f520b60d796053738", "ja": "この声は……まさか！", "zh": "这个声音是……难道是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c0f873e15988d319e3befac5d1bf872190514668d2f4f04b80b084a6e0857e7", "ja": "レディ・I！？", "zh": "淑女·I！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "f21e6bdd1cd1e3fd45b499cfbbcde2b3d95bb0d432ad6727b032cba3b69b788b", "ja": "ディーディー、ミス・Wも……！", "zh": "D.D.、W小姐也……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1028_acmaster", "source_sha256": "4a88864e8fa03487fe2f8ce4d566ea1adcf916fa78190a807464c1737e28b641", "ja": "な、なんだ貴様ら！？\nあの警備の中をどうやって……！？", "zh": "你、你们是什么人！？\n在那种严密的警备下，你们到底是怎么……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "feff26b3dcf33708e47033e5bc323de0dcd776dddab9965eeac39bc0b4bde0b9", "ja": "警備とは、廊下で転がっている方々のことですか？\n著しく水準が低かったので、見直しを推奨します。", "zh": "您说的警备，是指那些倒在走廊上的人吗？水平低得令人难以置信，建议重新评估。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "a2a3fa7e510efa8dd7b5f931539d710f02dea491a9d68191f82421cebd138392", "ja": "はい～。あっけないものでした～。", "zh": "是呀～真是不堪一击呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1031_acmaster", "source_sha256": "340d7ec2761b623270c67dfe3302e368f40827ba1c40260b5c070b1e97f5889f", "ja": "くっ！", "zh": "呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "f4d1108081407239afad1015cbcae2871bbb889ad6579a590d149725c0f348db", "ja": "ほら、『輝きのダイヤ』よ。\nこれでしょ？　あんたが欲しがってるのって。", "zh": "看吧，这就是《闪耀的钻石》。\n就是这个吧？你想要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "7c9d8911dfc43d02a8589a3d44e6c1a55606b90bfa540714a02b9872dd518474", "ja": "え？　で、でも……。", "zh": "诶？可、可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "19a4180cc10cf05d6b00c73638ad0f0698c1fef0270f45b8f9d8aebe5c0df427", "ja": "何か事情があるみたいだし。\nひとつ貸しにしておいてあげるわ。", "zh": "看来你似乎有什么难言之隐。\n这次就算我欠你一个人情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1035_007ior", "source_sha256": "e93f23fd0f392863a366c011650a18b7a36c825522047d01b9c82e2e2016f272", "ja": "それに、お宝はその価値に相応しいウサギが持ってこそ\n真価を発揮するものなのよ。", "zh": "而且，宝物只有交给与其价值相称的兔子，才能发挥真正的价值。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "c65e79da677608fba3cc7d60b2c642dad1ebfdc31e1052d6106080ad899c9ae2", "ja": "レディ・I……。", "zh": "淑女·I……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1037_acmaster", "source_sha256": "1d74d0c907ec5d99a179eeafec5e890ae36655e054e19990bf90903d3af0d8ce", "ja": "ふん！　貴様に価値などあるものか！\nそのダイヤは、私のような者にこそ相応しいもの！", "zh": "哼！你这种人根本毫无价值！\n那颗钻石，只有像我这样的人才配拥有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "15bfac6aa5765cb744342b7d665088435492762c177615f72623a556df08633f", "ja": "ほんと、あきれた。\n足りないのは、語彙力だけじゃないんだね。", "zh": "真是的，真让人无语。你缺的可不只是词汇量啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1039_007ior", "source_sha256": "648f64b8088effb99459233bae1b9564333b36830b6c17e2d10086fe59d7f510", "ja": "バカじゃないの？　あんた。\n自分の価値なんてものはね、自分で決めるのよ！", "zh": "你是不是傻？你这家伙。\n自己的价值这种东西，要由自己来决定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1041_007ior", "source_sha256": "119058c41ad31ebbd965ffc4e80d7e67961ac77c8fd4c27a873d92827e092981", "ja": "つまり……あんたが持っているお宝は、ぜーんぶ\n私が持っているべきだってこと！　にひひっ♪", "zh": "也就是说……你手里的宝物，全部都该归我才对！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1042_acmaster", "source_sha256": "f060e905343dc5851573cc0edb259d2e5c91ffca95dbdd9e6dd878f374e48f52", "ja": "こ、この天井知らずのゴーツクバリめ……！\nお前達、やってしまえ！", "zh": "这、这个贪得无厌的家伙……！\n你们，给我上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1043_acmaster", "source_sha256": "4ea2fee20604b8fa795d07a36918f4a0b53c318d390f17809fa03940a31a19bd", "ja": "この隙に、月の宝を持って脱出するぞ！", "zh": "趁现在，带着月之宝物逃出去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1044_007ior", "source_sha256": "c257712c30870f46e9010b98d34b31656ae2cebdf7e3adc09717dc7d387bea7e", "ja": "そうはさせないわ！　……月兎隊！", "zh": "不会让你得逞的！……月兔队！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1045_052kao", "source_sha256": "cf4d704411b706fb32fb7fca1c61142989a521b3de6d488bd0588f7b1010bd97", "ja": "これは私たちの、崇高なるミッション……。", "zh": "这是属于我们的崇高使命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "af03d64854fcc80013f9e0a3ee1517aa39637316ebbcdc114aed74d1536be35c", "ja": "後悔するには、ちょっと遅かったみたいだね。", "zh": "现在才后悔，似乎有点太迟了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1047_042miy", "source_sha256": "f4620134ddef6769e74e30b1c656fb3ad23669d37bb2c58e83cf48acb147e742", "ja": "おいたがすぎましたな～。反省するといいですよ～。", "zh": "你闹得有点过分了呢～好好反省一下吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1048_acmaster", "source_sha256": "22df0e7a8ed4b5dc80dd566d91fca6e728dcff00865a3391b252b208cb54868b", "ja": "な、なんだ！？　何が起こって……！\nぐぬう！　め、目が回る……！", "zh": "什、什么！？发生什么了……！\n唔呃！眼、眼睛转个不停……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1049_007ior", "source_sha256": "4fa0dd1e1a2389a6abab20b436e5f1d29b428941cef82df98826ae76454fec8e", "ja": "いくわよ……\n必殺！　イデアルちゃん、", "zh": "要上了……\n必杀技！理想小姐，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1050_007ior", "source_sha256": "27f1f8796afc9d02a00b116b30add15c542c951b99a2bba5ea2f696aa968cf0a", "ja": "キーーーーック！！！！", "zh": "踢——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1051_acmaster", "source_sha256": "2cafadbc06f7be9985b394283a7ea6f22513503079c3e91e1a81b15dfa0de558", "ja": "ぐああああああ！！！！", "zh": "啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1052_007ior", "source_sha256": "fbf531f972d3c06ab5b4f89d72b2adaa06196eace3b7064dff957e7b9546b9cd", "ja": "……ミッション・コンプリート♪", "zh": "……任务完成♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1053_007ior", "source_sha256": "15dae0f3d5d7d5807d2e683b4ae714f7fe531e7651556e8545ec943b928d8496", "ja": "どう？　ざっとこんなもんよ！", "zh": "怎么样？大概就是这么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1054_042miy", "source_sha256": "ce9dcdbc17e37f6e841b84eea2d985fc775373e2454ac2a6bd4afced5c8af62d", "ja": "お～。いい感じに、吹っ飛びましたな～。", "zh": "哦～。飞得很带劲呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1055_052kao", "source_sha256": "f70c32e082e3576e353727b4e5ee83de48803c655edde3ef24f9e54890202c98", "ja": "対象の生体反応、半径100キロ圏内からの\n消失を確認。お見事です、お嬢様。", "zh": "确认目标生命反应，已从半径100公里范围内\n消失。干得漂亮，大小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1056_014mir", "source_sha256": "f758d0301a4b6667b9f67d5d500dcd0feddd50dad7295fc0bdae970cb0821922", "ja": "え、ええええ！？　なんですかぁ、今の技！？", "zh": "诶、诶诶诶诶！？刚才那招是什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1057_049mom", "source_sha256": "1ba68d7f69fed54713bf42614190297bd6e8ddb1c999cb0944c35a5655d8cbc9", "ja": "あなた、知らなかったの？\nレディ・Iの特殊能力。", "zh": "你不知道吗？\n艾女士的特殊能力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0200_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_03_1058_014mir", "source_sha256": "5ae5ef2a0adf58ede5502c4546ff1046116992e9e96322f61bf0ab13a2be96de", "ja": "聞いてません……っていうか、私、\nこんな人たちを敵に回そうとしてたの？　ひええ……！", "zh": "我没听说过……话说回来，我刚才是想和这种人作对吗？呜哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
